  "label": "Gun Rights Movement",
  "description": "A political and social movement that advocates for the right to own and carry firearms, often based on the Second Amendment of the United States Constitution. The movement is associated with various political ideologies, including conservatism and libertarianism, and is often portrayed in media and memes as a symbol of American patriotism and individual freedom. The image of a man holding an assault rifle is a common visual representation of this movement.",
